<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Help · @@SITE_NAME@@</title>
<style>
body { margin: 0; color: #333; background: #fff; font: 15px/1.7 system-ui, sans-serif; }
main { max-width: 52rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2.5rem 1.25rem 3rem; }
h1 { margin: 0 0 1.5rem; font-size: 1.75rem; line-height: 1.25; }
h2 { margin: 2.25rem 0 0.75rem; padding-bottom: 0.3rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e5e5; font-size: 1.25rem; line-height: 1.3; }
h3 { margin: 1.5rem 0 0.5rem; font-size: 1.05rem; }
p, ul, ol { margin: 0 0 1rem; }
ul, ol { padding-left: 1.4rem; }
a { color: #0b57d0; text-decoration: none; }
a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
code { padding: 0.1em 0.35em; border-radius: 4px; background: #f2f2f2; font: 0.9em ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; }
pre { position: relative; overflow-x: auto; margin: 0 0 1.25rem; padding: 1.85rem 1rem 0.9rem; border: 1px solid #e5e5e5; border-radius: 6px; background: #f7f7f7; }
pre::before { content: attr(data-language); position: absolute; top: 0.4rem; left: 1rem; color: #888; font: 600 0.65rem/1 ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
pre code { display: block; padding: 0; background: none; font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.6; white-space: pre; }
footer { padding: 1em; text-align: center; font-size: 0.875em; }
footer a { color: #666; text-decoration: none; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
@@BODY@@
</main>
<footer>
  <a href="/">@@SITE_NAME@@</a> · <a href="https://beian.miit.gov.cn/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@@ICP_NUMBER@@</a>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
